<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Understudy Brain</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap">
  <%- themeCSS %>
</head>
<body class="brain-page">
  <main class="brain-shell">
    <header class="brain-topbar">
      <div class="brain-topbar-copy">
        <p class="brain-kicker">Understudy / Private Operating Brain</p>
        <h1>A private desk for questions, direction, memory, and next steps.</h1>
        <p class="brain-subtitle">This should feel like one place to think clearly, see what happened, and keep the useful parts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="brain-topbar-actions">
        <span class="brain-status-pill brain-status-pill-<%= procedureStatus.tone %>"><%= procedureStatus.label %></span>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <form action="/brain/logout" method="post">
          <button type="submit">Log out</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="brain-overview">
      <article class="brain-panel brain-overview-main">
        <div class="brain-panel-header">
          <h2>Today</h2>
          <span>Operating view</span>
        </div>
        <p class="brain-overview-lead"><%= procedureStatus.detail %></p>
        <div class="brain-overview-grid">
          <section>
            <h3>What this page is for</h3>
            <p>Ask one full question, get a structured answer, then decide what should become memory, research, or a real next action.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>What to do next</h3>
            <p><%= procedureStatus.nextStep %></p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="brain-panel brain-overview-side">
        <div class="brain-panel-header">
          <h2>System</h2>
          <span>Live</span>
        </div>
        <dl class="brain-metric-list">
          <div>
            <dt>Result</dt>
            <dd><%= procedureStatus.label %></dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Model path</dt>
            <dd><%= modelStatus.active %></dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Model detail</dt>
            <dd><%= modelStatus.detail %></dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Active tasks</dt>
            <dd><%= tasks.filter((task) => task.status !== 'done').length %></dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Memory notes</dt>
            <dd><%= (memory.notes || []).length %></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="brain-workbench">
      <article class="brain-panel brain-compose">
        <div class="brain-panel-header">
          <h2>Ask The Brain</h2>
          <span>Primary action</span>
        </div>

        <% if (sent) { %>
          <p class="brain-form-notice">Message saved and procedure run. Read the result state first, then review the answer below.</p>
        <% } %>

        <form class="brain-form" action="/brain/message" method="post">
          <label class="brain-form-field">
            <span>Mode</span>
            <select name="type">
              <option value="request">Ask</option>
              <option value="memory">Remember</option>
              <option value="research">Research</option>
            </select>
            <small>`Ask` is for normal questions. `Remember` stores durable notes. `Research` points the scout at a lane.</small>
          </label>

          <label class="brain-form-field brain-form-message">
            <span>Message</span>
            <textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Example: Where are we headed as a company over the next 90 days? Give me one direction, one risk, and one next action." required></textarea>
            <small>Best results come from one complete question with enough context to stand on its own.</small>
          </label>

          <button type="submit">Run Procedure</button>
        </form>

        <div class="brain-prompt-list">
          <p class="brain-prompt-label">Good prompt shapes</p>
          <ul>
            <li>What are the top three business directions for Understudy this month, and which one should I actually focus on?</li>
            <li>Turn this idea into one decision, one experiment, and one thing not to do yet.</li>
            <li>Save this as memory: Understudy should treat the homepage as the front door and the brain as the private workspace.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="brain-panel brain-latest">
        <div class="brain-panel-header">
          <h2>Latest Answer</h2>
          <span><%= latestProcedure ? latestProcedure.file : 'No procedure yet' %></span>
        </div>

        <% if (latestProcedure) { %>
          <div class="brain-latest-meta">
            <span class="brain-status-pill brain-status-pill-<%= procedureStatus.tone %>"><%= procedureStatus.label %></span>
            <span class="brain-meta-line">Mode: <%= latestProcedure.data.mode || 'unknown' %></span>
          </div>

          <p class="brain-question"><%= latestProcedure.data.question || 'Untitled procedure' %></p>

          <div class="brain-answer-grid">
            <section>
              <h3>Direction</h3>
              <p><%= (latestProcedure.data.ceo || latestProcedure.data.ceoAnswer || '').slice(0, 900) %></p>
            </section>
            <section>
              <h3>New Angle</h3>
              <p><%= (latestProcedure.data.scout || '').slice(0, 700) %></p>
            </section>
            <section>
              <h3>Risk Check</h3>
              <p><%= (latestProcedure.data.critic || latestProcedure.data.criticReview || '').slice(0, 700) %></p>
            </section>
            <section>
              <h3>Decision</h3>
              <p><%= (latestProcedure.data.synthesis || '').slice(0, 900) %></p>
            </section>
          </div>
        <% } else { %>
          <p class="brain-empty">Ask one direct question and the answer will show up here.</p>
        <% } %>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="brain-signals">
      <article class="brain-panel brain-scout-card">
        <div class="brain-panel-header">
          <h2>Latest Scout Brief</h2>
          <span><%= latestReport ? latestReport.file : 'No report yet' %></span>
        </div>

        <% if (latestReport) { %>
          <p class="brain-scout-heading"><%= latestReport.heading %></p>
          <ul class="brain-scout-summary">
            <% (latestReport.summaryLines || []).forEach((line) => { %>
              <li><%= line %></li>
            <% }) %>
          </ul>
          <details class="brain-report-detail">
            <summary>Open full scout brief</summary>
            <pre><%= latestReport.content.slice(0, 2200) %></pre>
          </details>
        <% } else { %>
          <p class="brain-empty">Once a scout brief lands, the summary will appear here first.</p>
        <% } %>
      </article>

      <aside class="brain-panel brain-memory-card">
        <div class="brain-panel-header">
          <h2>Operating Memory</h2>
          <span><%= memory.company && memory.company.name ? memory.company.name : 'Understudy' %></span>
        </div>
        <p class="brain-memory-title"><strong><%= memory.company && memory.company.name ? memory.company.name : 'Understudy' %></strong></p>
        <p class="brain-memory-copy"><%= memory.company && memory.company.position ? memory.company.position : 'Private parent company.' %></p>
        <ul class="brain-memory-list">
          <% (memory.principles || []).slice(-5).forEach((principle) => { %>
            <li><%= principle %></li>
          <% }) %>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="brain-library">
      <details class="brain-library-panel" open>
        <summary>
          <span>Scout Archive</span>
          <span><%= reports.length %> recent</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="brain-report-list">
          <% reports.forEach((report) => { %>
            <details class="brain-report-item">
              <summary><%= report.heading %></summary>
              <% if ((report.summaryLines || []).length) { %>
                <ul class="brain-report-bullets">
                  <% report.summaryLines.forEach((line) => { %>
                    <li><%= line %></li>
                  <% }) %>
                </ul>
              <% } %>
              <pre><%= report.content.slice(0, 1600) %></pre>
            </details>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="brain-library-panel">
        <summary>
          <span>State Log</span>
          <span>Full history</span>
        </summary>
        <pre class="brain-state"><%= scrollingState %></pre>
      </details>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
